<title>MEXICO: Strong winds close Mexican crude port Pajaritos.</title>
<headline>Strong winds close Mexican crude port Pajaritos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico crude shipping port Pajaritos was shut at 1330 local/1930 GMT as wind speeds reached between 50 and 60 km per hour in the region, the Communications and Transport Ministry said in a daily meteorological bulletin.</p>
<p>Mexico's two other key crude ports remained open, as a cold front in the Gulf of Mexico moved its way southeast.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
